    "date_gmt": "2023-04-10T11:22:57",
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Even if we do not talk about 5G (specifically), the security talent in general in the country is very sparse at the moment. We need to get more (security) professionals in the system.</p>\n"
    },
    "link": "https://gmquran.com/how-startups-are-cutting-cloud-costs-renegotiating-deals-with-service-providers/#comment-15",
    "status": "approved",
